      "content": "thanks this is a good start. can you make it a bit more personal though? like maybe instead of just saying \"shipping partners\" can you add a little something about why these logistics errors happen so it doesn't just sound like we're dodging blame? just something that makes it feel a bit more human and less corporate.",
